Subject: [PATCH] Step 10: record baseline, relax pass rule to <=2 stray words,
 add rescore and readability

- Baseline: 7/20 pass under a zero-stray-words rule; all failures were
  everyday words (eat, drink, bring...) and the 12-word vocabulary has
  almost no verbs; structure had 0 failures/leaks/off-length/bad format
- Relax the default pass rule to <=2 stray words (strict mode remains);
  record the decision in the test plan
- Add readability metrics (mean/longest words per sentence or line) and
  an optional --max-unit-words limit
- Add rescore_results and run_story_batch.py --rescore to re-score a saved
  run without generating anything
- Update test plan, README, CHANGELOG, DEVELOPER-DIARY, IMPLEMENTATION-GUIDE
